WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:04.952
How do I change an existing rep's sales, pricing and collection permissions in Field Sales?

2
00:00:05.767 --> 00:00:12.082
In the sidebar, click Sales reps. Then, on the row of the rep you want, click the edit icon in the Actions column.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.859
The Edit rep window opens. In the Sales permissions section, turn on or off what you need, such as Create invoice, Credit selling and Cash selling.

4
00:00:22.767 --> 00:00:30.532
In the Pricing permissions section, choose whether the rep can change the price or sell below price, and enter the maximum discount they are allowed to give.

5
00:00:31.433 --> 00:00:37.139
Scroll down to the Collection permissions section and choose whether the rep can issue, edit or cancel receipts.

6
00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:44.164
Click Save changes at the bottom of the window. A Rep updated message appears, and the new permissions apply to the rep.
